## Commands

### `swag` — Generate API Documentation
```bash
swag init -g ./cmd/api/main.go -o ./docs
```
> This regenerates the Swagger/OpenAPI documentation. Use when new endpoints or annotations are added.

---

### `create-migration` — Create a New Empty DB Migration
```bash
cd db/migrations && goose create $(name) sql
```
> Replace `$(name)` with a snake_case migration name. This creates a timestamped migration file (you must edit it manually).

---

### `sqlc` — Generate Typed DB Access Code
```bash
sqlc generate
```
> Runs SQLC to regenerate Go code for all `.sql` files in `db/queries/`. Required after adding or modifying SQL queries.
